# 1 Introduction

EGFR degradation is a key mechanism in targeted oncology therapy. This paragraph
establishes the background and motivation for the study described below.

## 1.1 Motivation

The unmet need is substantial across solid tumours.

# 2 Methods

We enrolled patients across three centres and applied the following criteria.

- Adults aged 18 or older
- Confirmed EGFR mutation
- No prior targeted therapy

| Arm | N | HR |
|-----|---|-----|
| Treatment | 120 | 0.62 |
| Control | 118 | 1.00 |

